@startuml mo_state_expenditures
title mo_state_expenditures: Missouri state expenditures (data.mo.gov)
start
:Socrata catalog: "<year> State Expenditures" dataset ids;
:for each fiscal year in MOGOV_LOOKBACK_YEARS (one shard unit each):
row count, then pages of 50,000 rows ordered by :id
